rules_where_no_trick_round_runs.cardlang:16:5: error: phase 'bidding' turns on rules with `active_rules:`, but no trick round runs in it or in a phase inside it: a rule is asked, and a mode's condition changes, only when a trick round offers a card (`round <move> from ... source ... into ...`), so none of it would ever apply — move it to the phase that runs the trick round, or, for a trick played with chosen moves, filter the move instead (`where follows_lead(card, <pile>)`)
